fixture had loaded, and expected the empty-chat offer. The fixture's
Duplicate Object is a person's edit logged into the active chat, and an
edit turns the offer into a thread with the setup bar in the composer's
place, so not_set_up_dock_is_one_live_offer failed on every run.

